config EXAMPLES_S31FSBENCH
	tristate "S31 committed filesystem numeric qualification"
	default n
	help
		Use standard stdio/POSIX calls for an 800000-byte file, separate
		setup/read/write/final-sync timing and complete data verification.
		Creates only safe-random.bin in an explicitly supplied directory;
		refuses to overwrite an existing file. This supplements original xTS.

